    sd:section "functional-design-docs/17 - Educator Cred - Temporary Credentials/17 Temporary Credentials - Daily Substitute Permit.docx" ;
    sd:notes "Full-depth pass. The only one of the eight FDD 17 documents with a formal numbered Addendum (Feature 17.1/17.2 user stories) — its own 17.1.x/17.2.x numbering is reused verbatim as this file's requirementId for its own Requirements." .

